DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260908T183000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Girls Soccer vs Marblehead (T 2–2)
LOCATION:Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 2\, Marblehead 2\nThe F
 alcons twice came back from a goal down in the first half of the season op
 ener but couldn't find a winner despite a 20–7 edge in shots. Mia St. Pi
 erre scored from a tough angle and Emma Sutherland got the second equalize
 r.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/sched
 ule.html?team=girls
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
END:VEVENT
