DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T163000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Girls Soccer vs Winthrop (W 9–1)
LOCATION:Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 9\, Winthrop 1\nMia St.
  Pierre and Rylee Sullivan both had hat tricks\, and Emma Sutherland added
  two goals and two assists as Danvers rolled to its first win.\nSchedule a
 nd results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=
 girls
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
END:VEVENT
