DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T183000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Girls Soccer vs North Reading (W 2–1)
LOCATION:Morse Field\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 2\, North Reading 1\nEmma Sutherland
  set up Rylee Sullivan's sixth goal of the season and then scored the go-a
 head goal herself in a non-league win on Danvers Youth Soccer Night.\nSche
 dule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html
 ?team=girls
