SUMMARY:Danvers Girls Soccer at Masconomet (L 1–5)
LOCATION:Masconomet Regional\, Boxford
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 1\, Masconomet 5\nA tou
 gh loss to a very talented Masconomet team. Mia St. Pierre scored a beauti
 ful goal and played well in the middle of the field.\nSchedule and results
 : https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
