DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T160000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Girls Soccer at Peabody (W 2–1)
LOCATION:Peabody Veterans Memorial HS\, Peabody
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 2\, Peabody 1\nIn a rai
 n and wind storm\, Rylee Sullivan tied it before halftime off an Emma Suth
 erland pass\, then set up Mia St. Pierre's winner in the first minute of t
 he second half as the Falcons stretched their unbeaten run to three.\nSche
 dule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html
 ?team=girls
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
END:VEVENT
