SUMMARY:Danvers Girls Soccer at Marblehead (L 0–3)
LOCATION:Piper Field\, Marblehead
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 0\, Marblehead 3\nDanve
 rs carried the play early but fell behind and couldn't recover\, getting s
 hut out for the first time this fall.\nSchedule and results: https://danve
 rsfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
