DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261002T160000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Girls Soccer at Bishop Fenwick (T 2–2)
LOCATION:Donaldson Field\, Peabody
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 2\, Bishop Fenwick 2\nRylee Sullivan
  scored with five minutes left to earn a draw on the road. Emma Sutherland
  had put Danvers ahead in the 12th minute\, and the Falcons held a big edg
 e in shots on goal.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics
 .org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
END:VEVENT
