DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261005T163000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Girls Soccer at Swampscott (W 3–0)
LOCATION:Blocksidge Field\, Swampscott
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Swampscott 0\nIn wh
 at coach Jimmy Hinchion called his team's best win of the season\, Rylee S
 ullivan scored in the first half and Mia St. Pierre and Emma Sutherland ad
 ded goals after the break. Taylor Landry earned the shutout in goal.\nSche
 dule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html
 ?team=girls
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
