DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T180000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Girls Soccer vs Lynnfield (W 4–0)
LOCATION:Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 4\, Lynnfield 0\nIn what coach Jimmy
  Hinchion called the team's most complete game of the season\, Rylee Sulli
 van scored twice\, Mia St. Pierre had a goal and an assist\, and Taylor La
 ndry kept another clean sheet.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalco
 nsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
END:VEVENT
