DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T183000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Girls Soccer vs Beverly (L 0–2)
LOCATION:Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 0\, Beverly 2\nBeverly 
 scored twice in the second half to complete a season sweep. Danvers had it
 s chances but couldn't crack the Panthers' defense\, which posted its four
 th straight shutout.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletic
 s.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
END:VEVENT
