DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T150000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Girls Soccer at Andover (T 1–1)
LOCATION:Lovely Stadium\, Andover
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 1\, Andover 1\nJunior captain Maddie
  Hanas scored in the first half off a Rylee Sullivan assist\, and the Falc
 ons held on through a defensive second half for a road draw that moved the
 m a step closer to the state tournament.\nSchedule and results: https://da
 nversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=girls
